{"unit_id":"WuWL-98__dsh-theme-paper#feature-1","repo":"WuWL-98/dsh-theme-paper","commit":"a13f7a3383543f14e1a50a58ee25865ea1185ed6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-theme-paper 的功能「暖色纸质配色」：为 DSH Web 注册奶油背景、暖墨文字、陶土强调色、衬线字体与代码语法色。启用纸质主题后，这些配色和字体通过主题 token 同步生效。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:46-52","lib/client.js:174-180"]}
