{"unit_id":"WuWL-98__dsh-theme-paper#feature-3","repo":"WuWL-98/dsh-theme-paper","commit":"a13f7a3383543f14e1a50a58ee25865ea1185ed6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-theme-paper 的功能「记住纸质主题选择」：选择纸质主题时将标记写入浏览器 localStorage，重新载入时读取标记并恢复主题；切换回其他选项会清除该标记。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:194-225","lib/client.js:226-257"]}
{"unit_id":"WuWL-98__dsh-theme-paper#caveat-1","repo":"WuWL-98/dsh-theme-paper","commit":"a13f7a3383543f14e1a50a58ee25865ea1185ed6","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-theme-paper 使用浏览器 localStorage 记住纸质主题选择；若浏览器存储不可用，主题仍可在当前页面切换，但偏好无法持久保存。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:194-225"]}
